{"articleNo":"557488","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=557488&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[장학] 「2026년도 인천 청년 해외배낭연수 」장학생 선발","writer":"학생성공과","writeDate":"2026.03.30","hit":"4493","attachments":[{"name":"2026년도 인천 청년 해외배낭연수 장학생 선발 공고문.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=557488&attachNo=162614"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/cms/plugin/editorImage.do?EwBmDYHoQZkglA7gJwFIDUD2A3AZsgdQFUAvAYVQBEAtASQA8SBTAOgCsAHAcyA%20\" class=\"txc-image\" style=\"clear:none;float:none;\"></p><p><br></p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -19.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"text-indent: -19.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">재</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -19.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"text-indent: -19.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">인천인재평생교육진흥원에서 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -19.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -19.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2026</span><span style=\"text-indent: -19.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">년도 인천 청년 해외배낭연수</span><span style=\"text-indent: -19.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">」 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -19.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">장학생을 다음과 같이 선발합니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-indent: -19.7pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">많은 학생들의 관심과 지원 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">가</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. </span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">사 업 명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: </span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">「</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">2026</span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">년도 인천 청년 해외배낭연수 </span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">」</span><span style=\"text-indent: -14.6pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">장학생 선발&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.6pt; text-indent: -14.6pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">접수기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: <b>2026. 4. 3.(</b></span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">금</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">) ~ 4. 30.(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.6pt; text-indent: -14.6pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">선발대상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">인천 청년 만 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">19</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">세 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">~ 34</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">세 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">세부 모집 기준 공고문 참조</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">)&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.6pt; text-indent: -14.6pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;라</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">선발인원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: 5</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">개팀 내외</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">팀당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">3~4</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">명으로 구성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.6pt; text-indent: -14.6pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;마</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">지원내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: </span><b><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">해외배낭연수 경비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">팀당 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">1,000</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">만원 이내</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">)</span></b></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.6pt; text-indent: -14.6pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp; &nbsp;※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">모집대륙별 최대 지원 경비금액이 상이하므로 세부 내용은 공고문 참고</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 14.6pt; text-indent: -14.6pt; line-height: 1.5;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;바</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">. </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">연수내용</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">: </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">팀 별 주제에 따라 해외장소 및 기관 방문 탐방 후 결과보고 제출</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"></p><div id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" data-jsonlen=\"13088\"><!--[data-hwpjson]{\n\"documentPr\": {\n\"di\": \"\",\n\"dp\": {\n\"dn\": \"test.hwp\",\n\"ta\": 1,\n\"d1\": 5,\n\"d2\": 1,\n\"dv\": 0,\n\"dr\": 1,\n\"do\": 1,\n\"vj\": \"1.1\",\n\"an\": \"Hancom Office Hangul\",\n\"av\": \"12, 0, 0, 4426\",\n\"ao\": \"WIN\",\n\"ab\": \"32\",\n\"ar\": \"LE\",\n\"as\": \"Windows_10\"\n},\n\"dis\": false,\n\"ds\": {\n\"ti\": \"\",\n\"la\": \"ko\",\n\"cr\": \"\",\n\"su\": \"\",\n\"de\": \"\",\n\"cd\": \"2026-03-30T10:08:52.169Z\",\n\"ke\": \"\"\n}\n},\n\"dh\": {\n\"do